From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath: expose the common module in Kconfig

Give the shared Atheros module a visible tristate prompt so OpenWrt can
select it independently of an individual wireless driver.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/Kconfig
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC
 config ATH_COMMON
-	tristate
+	tristate "ath.ko"
 	depends on m
 
 config WLAN_VENDOR_ATH
